         <dc:description>
            <rdf:Alt>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">This amendment to IEEE Std 802.1Q-2011 specifies protocols, procedures, and managed objects that enable flow control per traffic class on IEEE 802Â® point-to-point full duplex&#xA;links. This is achieved by a mechanism similar to IEEE 802.3 Annex 31B PAUSE, but operating on individual priorities.</rdf:li>
            </rdf:Alt>
         </dc:description>
         <dc:subject>
            <rdf:Bag>
               <rdf:li>flow control</rdf:li>
               <rdf:li>IEEE 802.1Qbb</rdf:li>
